Provenance of distilled patterns

The PR-review and PR-author skills under `skills/` and the corresponding
notes under `memories/` (notably `pr-review-techniques.md` and
`sig-auth-rigor.md`) are abstracted patterns extracted from the
publicly-visible PR-review and code-comment history of senior open-source
maintainers in the Kubernetes / OPA / cert-manager ecosystems. The raw
mining corpora — which include personally-attributable phrasing and
timing information — are NOT redistributed in this repository. Only the
abstracted ruleset is published.

If you fork or extend these skills, please preserve this provenance
notice and the abstraction-only redistribution practice.

