Third-party content

The `skills/autoreview` payload is vendored unchanged from
`openclaw/agent-skills` commit
`2a409d348a4bcf6f15e41e9a20efd0b298a32528` under the MIT License.
Copyright (c) 2026 openclaw. Its license is reproduced at
`skills/autoreview/LICENSE`.

The agentkit shell scripts (`scripts/wt`,
`scripts/session-log-compile.sh`) depend at runtime on `git`, `jq`,
`find`, and `bash`; these dependencies are not redistributed.

`upstream-skills.json` records evaluated external skills by repository,
license, and commit. `vendored-skills.json` records copied skill source,
license, commit, and subtree. No other external skill source is copied.

The optional Mermaid support in the PR review dashboard template loads
Mermaid 10.9.1 from jsDelivr with a pinned URL and subresource integrity.
Mermaid is not bundled with agentkit.
